4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Me9ncS8iSoQ7kNvwHKKtsl&_nc_oc=AdrN6Vmw0O-eYmCjqxs05WrZs-nGhFisJ7BybzfksfefRzxZmjWDAfoq8VhOcfftauY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN9Dj6yc7Qor8cXZboExBUGei6bYI3bC36MKLwb0yHu1g&oe=6AE34454"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7p-lMH6fGW8Q7kNvwFxBJMI&_nc_oc=AdqT_Hsw1AkhS8i3qeij0FtvWsWgmfeMyosixCbxciVxL8oyx6xCNf4xdIzbiQDAYwI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNnLrq8iAY-FEUJMFco7x6NU042kAA-vghaitXo8pkroA&oe=6AE34932"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mE1Wp1DXwccQ7kNvwE72iKB&_nc_oc=AdrBolPMVi4N-YXcZA2-1aWk89ozvkfYFYKbkqPVMrukiSK0N3n5UfqBzuVnbdO3yTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO0512gjSDcSrMNT012QmXcYVilWDri2WkjXdS_ktVMZA&oe=6AE356D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p